    "description": {
      "summary": "Phantom Armies, also known as spirit hosts, spectral battles, or aerial armies, are large-scale collective apparitions involving the ghostly manifestation of soldiers, warriors, or entire military engagements.",
      "full": "Phantom Armies, also known as spirit hosts, spectral battles, or aerial armies, are large-scale collective apparitions involving the ghostly manifestation of soldiers, warriors, or entire military engagements. These phenomena typically involve the sounds and sights of historical battles replaying themselves, often in the sky or on historic battlefields. Unlike individual ghosts, phantom armies represent mass hauntings with dozens to thousands of spectral figures appearing simultaneously. Witnesses report hearing battle sounds, seeing formations of soldiers, observing cavalry charges, and watching entire engagements unfold as if history were replaying itself."
    },
